00:46:16,580 --> 00:46:17,520
I'm going out there.

546
00:46:18,340 --> 00:46:19,600
No, we need to stay together.

547
00:46:19,600 --> 00:46:20,760
I'm going.

548
00:47:03,080 --> 00:47:05,130
-Bran. Bran.  -Hodor. Hodor.

549
00:47:05,280 --> 00:47:07,250
-Hodor.  -Bran, what happened?

550
00:47:07,250 --> 00:47:09,950
Summer, he's hurt. They've caught him in a trap.

551
00:47:10,030 --> 00:47:10,930
Who?

552
00:47:11,240 --> 00:47:13,600
I didn't see, but they have my brother's wolf.

553
00:47:16,070 --> 00:47:17,050
They have Ghost.

554
00:47:23,340 --> 00:47:24,300
They're Night's Watch.

555
00:47:25,450 --> 00:47:26,200
Look.

556
00:47:27,410 --> 00:47:28,490
Jon might be here.

557
00:47:29,310 --> 00:47:31,830
If Jon was here, why would they put his wolf in a cage?

558
00:47:39,180 --> 00:47:41,110
They might have been Night's Watch once, not anymore.

559
00:47:41,920 --> 00:47:43,110
We're not safe here. We need to go.

560
00:47:43,320 --> 00:47:44,130
No.

561
00:47:44,820 --> 00:47:46,960
Bran, we need to go now.

562
00:47:47,480 --> 00:47:48,990
I'm not leaving without Summer.

563
00:47:56,320 --> 00:47:57,730
Can you remember where the cage was?

564
00:47:58,240 --> 00:47:59,940
The east side of the keep.

565
00:48:02,290 --> 00:48:03,740
If I'm not back soon, we'll meet.

566
00:48:05,720 --> 00:48:06,360
Hodor.

567
00:48:21,120 --> 00:48:21,890
Hodor.

568
00:48:25,470 --> 00:48:26,670
Hodor. Hodor.

569
00:48:31,120 --> 00:48:31,890
Hodor.

570
00:48:33,570 --> 00:48:36,630
If I was your size, I'd be king of the fucking world.

571
00:48:48,820 --> 00:48:49,690
Help him up.

572
00:49:13,470 --> 00:49:14,540
This is nice.

573
00:49:16,680 --> 00:49:17,760
Fine leather.

574
00:49:20,150 --> 00:49:21,670
You're no wildling.

575
00:49:22,410 --> 00:49:24,260
Important. Highborn.

576
00:49:27,300 --> 00:49:28,240
Who are you?

577
00:49:38,530 --> 00:49:39,980
You see, where I come from,

578
00:49:40,100 --> 00:49:42,680
a commoner like me slaps a little lord like you,

579
00:49:43,190 --> 00:49:44,640
I'd lose my right hand.

580
00:49:45,890 --> 00:49:48,560
But we're a long way from home, aren't we?

581
00:49:51,190 --> 00:49:52,250
And the two of you,

582
00:49:52,690 --> 00:49:56,010
fancy-looking folks north of the Wall

583
00:49:56,140 --> 00:49:57,950
creeping through the woods.

584
00:49:59,820 --> 00:50:01,160
Isn't that a bit odd?

585
00:50:05,070 --> 00:50:06,840
I like your curly hair.

586
00:50:09,410 --> 00:50:11,670
My mom had curls like that.

587
00:50:13,260 --> 00:50:15,310
Beautiful brown curls.

588
00:50:16,870 --> 00:50:19,930
Why'd you drag a crippled boy all the way up here?

589
00:50:25,110 --> 00:50:27,470
See you haven't played this game before.

590
00:50:29,620 --> 00:50:30,950
A highborn hostage,

591
00:50:32,570 --> 00:50:33,520
that's valuable.

592
00:50:35,270 --> 00:50:36,300
But three of them,

593
00:50:38,160 --> 00:50:40,110
that's a lot of mouths to feed.

594
00:50:41,540 --> 00:50:43,090
-What the fuck's wrong with him?  -Come here.

595
00:50:44,150 --> 00:50:47,010
No, please. Please. Please, let me help him.

596
00:50:47,130 --> 00:50:48,910
-Who are you?  -Please.

597
00:50:49,250 --> 00:50:51,920
-Who are you?  -I'm Brandon Stark!

598
00:50:52,170 --> 00:50:54,280
I'm Brandon Stark of Winterfell.

599
00:50:57,350 --> 00:50:58,560
It's Jon Snow's brother.

600
00:51:01,930 --> 00:51:04,040
It's Meera. It's Meera. I'm right here.

601
00:51:04,040 --> 00:51:08,020
And I thought this was gonna be another boring day.

